cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MSPA in a publication, please cite the references below."
title: "MSPA – Morphological Spatial Pattern Analysis (standalone build)"
abstract: >-
  Standalone build setup for MSPA, a sequence of mathematical morphological
  operators that classifies the foreground of a binary image into core,
  islet, perforation, edge, loop, bridge, branch and background classes.
  Binaries are provided for Linux, MS-Windows and macOS on x86_64 and ARM64.
